hub.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T03:41:05Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T03:41:05Z","body":"+1 to add but I would lean towards maybe making the last part about the donated typefaces optional?\r\n\r\n@n8willis - do you have links to the precise place in source that the other two variants appear? I just see a link to an email thread. Or maybe we just address the license that has been requested and deal with the other variants when/iff someone finds them and submits them here?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1722712167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1723094108","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121#issuecomment-1723094108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121","id":1723094108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85mtFRc","user":{"login":"n8willis","id":2192132,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTIxMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2192132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis","html_url":"https://github.com/n8willis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n8willis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T09:58:21Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T09:58:21Z","body":"> @n8willis - do you have links to the precise place in source that the other two variants appear? I just see a link to an email thread. Or maybe we just address the license that has been requested and deal with the other variants when/iff someone finds them and submits them here?\r\n\r\nI genuinely just don't have the time to re-do the search at the moment; I'm in the final weeks of PhD work. I'd be happy to revisit it c. next month or so, but I don't have it on hand and — being totally honest — can't afford the time at present. I think it's findable if others look, but it can't be me if it's urgent, regrettably.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1723094108/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725371462","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121#issuecomment-1725371462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121","id":1725371462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85m1xRG","user":{"login":"BrianInglis","id":23089181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDg5MTgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23089181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis","html_url":"https://github.com/BrianInglis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-19T12:01:38Z","updated_at":"2023-09-19T12:01:38Z","body":"[GS repo](https://git.ghostscript.com/?p=ghostpdl.git;a=blob;f=Resource/Init/Fontmap.GS;hb=HEAD#l177)\r\n[GS font licence](https://ghostscript.com/~tor/stuff/fonts/utopia/LICENSE-utopia.txt)\r\n[CTAN repo](https://www.ctan.org/tex-archive/fonts/utopia/)\r\n[CTAN font licence](http://mirrors.ctan.org/fonts/utopia/LICENSE-utopia.txt)\r\n\r\nFrom [Wikipedia ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Utopia_(typeface)) article, Adobe still sells a commercial font package under that name, enhanced from those originals, and successfully sued a company for passing those along under the [ironic] name *Veracity*.\r\n\r\nSo it may be necessary to be safe and specify that those licences apply to the specific open sourced variants, their metadata, and derived font formats. \r\n\r\nUnder the terms, modified fonts must adhere to the original licence, but use another name, and some have done so. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725371462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736141730","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121#issuecomment-1736141730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121","id":1736141730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ne2ui","user":{"login":"InSwiss","id":6169105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjkxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6169105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss","html_url":"https://github.com/InSwiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-26T19:12:28Z","updated_at":"2023-09-26T19:12:28Z","body":"+1 to add and agree with @n8willis that license name should be Adobe-Utopia-X for clarity on the fonts for which the license is and the font list should be included as the first line of the license text mentions \"the listed typefaces\" ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736141730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736468923","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121#issuecomment-1736468923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121","id":1736468923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ngGm7","user":{"login":"whot","id":1487352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODczNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1487352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot","html_url":"https://github.com/whot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-27T00:17:01Z","updated_at":"2023-09-27T00:17:01Z","body":"I've changed the name to `Adobe-Utopia-X` for now to avoid accidentally forgetting to do so later","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736468923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736633040","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121#issuecomment-1736633040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2121","id":1736633040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ngurQ","user":{"login":"BrianInglis","id":23089181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDg5MTgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23089181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis","html_url":"https://github.com/BrianInglis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianInglis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-27T03:56:48Z","updated_at":"2023-09-27T04:01:22Z","body":"*X* is ambiguous and not really relevant here, unless you can find the original *Adobe* grant to the *X Project Consortium*, in which case *X11R5* would be a better descriptor and discriminator. \r\nBut it would be more accurate and discriminate better to append *-Type1*, as distinct from later offerings by *Adobe* and others, where only *Adobe* has the right to use the name *Utopia*, but others must acknowledge the grant, and change the name if the fonts are modified in any way from the originals, if that clause is considered to be in effect. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736633040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"mi